      },
      "ground_truth": "Known Pydantic repair tracked by issue #13520. In the unfixed snapshot, safe_get_annotations uses inherited attribute lookup for classes. A class without its own annotations can therefore expose an inherited or metaclass annotation mapping to field collection, changing which fields and type variables Pydantic sees after another integration inspects annotations. Accept only findings that connect class annotation lookup to the reported order-dependent model behavior. Do not count unrelated generic model behavior.",
      "references": [
        "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/issues/13520",
